      "claim": "The query is a polar guanine carbocyclic nucleoside; although passive permeability is predicted to be unfavorable, the consistent nucleoside analog F values above 20% support F ≥ 20% at this threshold, and no transferable affirmative evidence indicates F < 20%.",
